L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.719" end="30.271">Chirp</span><span begin="30.271" end="30.533">ing</span> <span begin="30.533" end="30.742">birds</span> <span begin="30.742" end="30.951">and</span> <span begin="30.951" end="31.279">sun</span><span begin="31.279" end="31.944">shine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雀鸟啼鸣，晴光正好</span></p><p begin="33.609" end="37.081" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.609" end="33.840">Are</span> <span begin="33.840" end="34.341">telling</span> <span begin="34.341" end="34.565">me,</span> <span begin="34.565" end="35.013">&quot;To</span><span begin="35.013" end="35.483">day</span> <span begin="35.483" end="35.692">will</span> <span begin="35.692" end="36.058">be</span> <span begin="36.058" end="36.416">dif</span><span begin="36.416" end="36.521">fer</span><span begin="36.521" end="37.081">ent&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都在轻声呢喃：“今日定会不同以往”</span></p><p begin="37.439" end="39.545" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.439" end="37.641">&apos;Cause</span> <span begin="37.641" end="38.104">these</span> <span begin="38.104" end="38.350">years</span> <span begin="38.350" end="38.582">are</span> <span begin="38.582" end="38.977">my</span> <span begin="38.977" end="39.545">prime</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只因这正是我芳华最盛的年纪</span></p><p begin="41.202" end="44.816" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.202" end="41.445">Put</span> <span begin="41.445" end="41.665">on</span> <span begin="41.665" end="41.897">a</span> <span begin="41.897" end="42.143">hap</span><span begin="42.143" end="42.629">py</span> <span begin="42.629" end="43.039">face</span> <span begin="43.039" end="43.181">and</span> <span begin="43.181" end="43.659">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="43.659" end="44.070">be</span> <span begin="44.070" end="44.816">fine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要缀上笑靥，便能万事无忧</span></p><p begin="46.720" end="48.236" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.720" end="47.131">An</span><span begin="47.131" end="47.497">gel</span><span begin="47.497" end="47.870">ic</span> <span begin="47.870" end="48.236">bells</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如天使般清越的钟声</span></p><p begin="48.654" end="50.237" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.654" end="49.072">Ding-</span><span begin="49.072" end="49.453">dong-</span><span begin="49.453" end="49.804">ding-</span><span begin="49.804" end="50.237">dong</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">叮咚——叮咚——</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="50.528" end="52.014"><span begin="50.528" end="50.961">(Ding-</span><span begin="50.961" end="51.327">dong-</span><span begin="51.327" end="51.701">ding-</span><span begin="51.701" end="52.014">dong)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">叮咚——叮咚——</span></span></p><p begin="52.358" end="53.978" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.358" end="52.865">Ding-</span><span begin="52.865" end="53.216">dong-</span><span begin="53.216" end="53.597">ding-</span><span begin="53.597" end="53.978">dong</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">叮咚——叮咚——</span></p><p begin="54.314" end="55.762" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.314" end="54.754">SIN</span> <span begin="54.754" end="55.456">COS</span> <span begin="55.456" end="55.762">TAN</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正弦 余弦 正切</span></p><p begin="55.979" end="59.533" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.979" end="56.181">A</span> <span begin="56.181" end="56.412">tri</span><span begin="56.412" end="56.658">an</span><span begin="56.658" end="56.897">gu</span><span begin="56.897" end="57.353">lar</span> <span begin="57.353" end="57.853">thought</span> <span begin="57.853" end="58.331">danc</span><span begin="58.331" end="58.570">ing</span> <span begin="58.570" end="58.794">in</span> <span begin="58.794" end="59.033">pow</span><span begin="59.033" end="59.257">dered</span> <span begin="59.257" end="59.533">chalk</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">三角般的思绪，在纷扬的粉笔灰里翩然起舞</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="59.832" end="1:01.479"><span begin="59.832" end="1:00.068">(Chalk</span> <span begin="1:00.068" end="1:00.299">chalk</span> <span begin="1:00.299" end="1:00.755">chalk</span> <span begin="1:00.755" end="1:00.986">chalk</span> <span begin="1:00.986" end="1:01.225">chalk</span> <span begin="1:01.225" end="1:01.479">chalk)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">粉笔 粉笔 粉笔 粉笔 粉笔 粉笔</span></span></p><p begin="1:01.960" end="1:03.446" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.960" end="1:02.423">Let&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:02.423" end="1:02.781">draw</span> <span begin="1:02.781" end="1:03.076">a</span> <span begin="1:03.076" end="1:03.446">line</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们落笔一线</span></p><p begin="1:03.834" end="1:05.335" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.834" end="1:04.334">Cir</span><span begin="1:04.334" end="1:04.655">cling</span> <span begin="1:04.655" end="1:04.946">the</span> <span begin="1:04.946" end="1:05.335">heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将这颗心轻柔圈起</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:05.730" end="1:07.284"><span begin="1:05.730" end="1:06.178">(Cir</span><span begin="1:06.178" end="1:06.694">cling</span> <span begin="1:06.694" end="1:06.925">the</span> <span begin="1:06.925" end="1:07.284">heart)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将这颗心轻柔圈起</span></span></p><p begin="1:07.642" end="1:09.076" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.642" end="1:08.075">Cir</span><span begin="1:08.075" end="1:08.568">cling</span> <span begin="1:08.568" end="1:08.807">the</span> <span begin="1:08.807" end="1:09.076">heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将这颗心轻柔圈起</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:09.553" end="1:10.950"><span begin="1:09.553" end="1:10.001">(Cir</span><span begin="1:10.001" end="1:10.457">cling</span> <span begin="1:10.457" end="1:10.696">the</span> <span begin="1:10.696" end="1:10.950">heart)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将这颗心轻柔圈起</span></span></p><p begin="1:11.383" end="1:12.861" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.383" end="1:11.876">Cir</span><span begin="1:11.876" end="1:12.361">cling</span> <span begin="1:12.361" end="1:12.570">the</span> <span begin="1:12.570" end="1:12.861">heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将这颗心轻柔圈起</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:13.339" end="1:14.735"><span begin="1:13.339" end="1:13.765">(Cir</span><span begin="1:13.765" end="1:14.257">cling</span> <span begin="1:14.257" end="1:14.489">the</span> <span begin="1:14.489" end="1:14.735">heart)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将这颗心轻柔圈起</span></span></p><p begin="1:15.191" end="1:16.684" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.191" end="1:15.639">Cir</span><span begin="1:15.639" end="1:16.161">cling</span> <span begin="1:16.161" end="1:16.385">the</span> <span begin="1:16.385" end="1:16.684">heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将这颗心轻柔圈起</span></p><p begin="1:17.140" end="1:21.172" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.140" end="1:17.565">With</span> <span begin="1:17.565" end="1:17.938">a</span> <span begin="1:17.938" end="1:18.222">fan</span><span begin="1:18.222" end="1:18.999">fare</span> <span begin="1:18.999" end="1:19.447">my</span> <span begin="1:19.447" end="1:19.857">fic</span><span begin="1:19.857" end="1:20.164">tion</span> <span begin="1:20.164" end="1:21.172">starts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">盛大的号角奏响，我的幻想序幕就此揭开</span></p><p begin="1:24.830" end="1:26.264" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.830" end="1:25.233">We</span> <span begin="1:25.233" end="1:25.592">are</span> <span begin="1:25.592" end="1:25.883">the</span> <span begin="1:25.883" end="1:26.264">stars</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们便是星辰般耀眼的主角</span></p><p begin="1:26.660" end="1:29.086" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.660" end="1:27.130">A</span> <span begin="1:27.130" end="1:27.503">beau</span><span begin="1:27.503" end="1:27.809">ti</span><span begin="1:27.809" end="1:28.101">ful</span> <span begin="1:28.101" end="1:28.437">af</span><span begin="1:28.437" end="1:29.086">fair</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">共赴一场绮丽的篇章</span></p><p begin="1:30.736" end="1:32.644" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.736" end="1:30.990">So</span> <span begin="1:30.990" end="1:31.199">in</span> <span begin="1:31.199" end="1:31.431">the</span> <span begin="1:31.431" end="1:31.657">dai</span><span begin="1:31.657" end="1:31.909">ly</span> <span begin="1:31.909" end="1:32.644">episodes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于是在往复的日常剧集里</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:32.834" end="1:34.417"><span begin="1:32.834" end="1:33.001">(So</span> <span begin="1:33.001" end="1:33.185">in</span> <span begin="1:33.185" end="1:33.387">the</span> <span begin="1:33.387" end="1:33.604">dai</span><span begin="1:33.604" end="1:33.850">ly</span> <span begin="1:33.850" end="1:34.417">episodes)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">往复的日常剧集里</span></span></p><p begin="1:34.604" end="1:37.994" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.604" end="1:34.821">To</span><span begin="1:34.821" end="1:35.037">geth</span><span begin="1:35.037" end="1:35.284">er,</span> <span begin="1:35.284" end="1:35.500">we&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:35.500" end="1:35.978">al</span><span begin="1:35.978" end="1:36.486">ways</span> <span begin="1:36.486" end="1:36.687">the</span> <span begin="1:36.687" end="1:37.031">main</span> <span begin="1:37.031" end="1:37.173">char</span><span begin="1:37.173" end="1:37.255">ac</span><span begin="1:37.255" end="1:37.994">ters</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们永远并肩，成为故事的主角</span></p><p begin="1:38.414" end="1:40.199" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.414" end="1:38.661">And</span> <span begin="1:38.661" end="1:38.855">this</span> <span begin="1:38.855" end="1:39.086">is</span> <span begin="1:39.086" end="1:39.615">our</span> <span begin="1:39.615" end="1:39.930">own</span> <span begin="1:39.930" end="1:40.199">show</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这方天地，是独属于我们的舞台</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:40.371" end="1:42.073"><span begin="1:40.371" end="1:40.580">(And</span> <span begin="1:40.580" end="1:40.789">this</span> <span begin="1:40.789" end="1:41.013">is</span> <span begin="1:41.013" end="1:41.491">our</span> <span begin="1:41.491" end="1:41.864">own</span> <span begin="1:41.864" end="1:42.073">show)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">独属于我们的舞台</span></span></p><p begin="1:42.260" end="1:45.694" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.260" end="1:42.476">Un</span><span begin="1:42.476" end="1:42.685">leash</span><span begin="1:42.685" end="1:42.917">ing</span> <span begin="1:42.917" end="1:43.126">our</span> <span begin="1:43.126" end="1:43.596">su</span><span begin="1:43.596" end="1:44.000">per</span> <span begin="1:44.000" end="1:44.209">spe</span><span begin="1:44.209" end="1:44.664">cial</span> <span begin="1:44.664" end="1:45.060">pow</span><span begin="1:45.060" end="1:45.694">ers</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">肆意绽放出无与伦比的奇迹之力</span></p><p begin="1:46.001" end="1:48.076" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.001" end="1:46.240">We&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:46.240" end="1:46.456">fight</span> <span begin="1:46.456" end="1:46.934">against</span> <span begin="1:46.934" end="1:47.188">the</span> <span begin="1:47.188" end="1:48.076">evil</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们将向世间恶念挥剑</span></p><p begin="1:49.771" end="1:53.13